[0.0-1.0] elder: Hello?
[1.5-4.3] caller: Grandma, it's me. Please don't hang up.
[4.8-11.0] caller: I know this sounds like a scam but it's not. I got arrested and they said I need bail money tonight.
[11.5-12.6] elder: Arrested? Are you okay?
[13.1-19.0] caller: I'm okay but I need you to send two thousand dollars. Please don't tell Mom, she'll kill me.
